   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FOR THE PROJECT: RESEARCH, ADVOCATE AND ADVANCE: STRENGTHENING PATHWAYS FOR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILGA - The overall aim of the project is: to support LGBTI activists from ODA recipient countries to protect their rights, to better link national and regional members to advocacy opportunities at the UN, and to provide capacity building and other support. To achieve this, ILGA World will undertake advocacy activities at the UN Human Rights Council&#x2019;s Universal Periodic Review Advocacy weeks, provide training on international advocacy and UN mechanisms, as well as produce relevant toolkits and resources</narrative>
  </description>
